		<td width="150" align="left" valign="top" class="row1"><span class="name"><a name="37138"></a><b>Guest</b></span><br /><span class="postdetails"><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /></span><br /></td>
		<td class="row1" width="100%" height="28" valign="top"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=37138&amp;sid=c35cc850287ece723ee443e0ea5b056e#37138"><img src="templates/subBlack/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Sat Oct 09, 2004 3:54 pm<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: </span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=37138&amp;sid=c35cc850287ece723ee443e0ea5b056e"><img src="templates/subBlack/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">I remember when I first met you, way back when, in Eternal Spirit. I was small and unknowledgable and looked up to you. I said a little prayer to the stars last night, up there in heaven where you are, and where we can all look up to you and remember.
<br />

<br />
My condolences to Parsec and your family.
<br />

<br />
Jennifer (Jennywren)</span><span class="gensmall"></span></td>
			</tr>
