		<td width="150" align="left" valign="top" class="row2"><span class="name"><a name="37140"></a><b>Guest</b></span><br /><span class="postdetails"><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /></span><br /></td>
		<td class="row2" width="100%" height="28" valign="top"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=37140&amp;sid=c35cc850287ece723ee443e0ea5b056e#37140"><img src="templates/subBlack/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Sat Oct 09, 2004 4:24 pm<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: </span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=37140&amp;sid=c35cc850287ece723ee443e0ea5b056e"><img src="templates/subBlack/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">When the storm is gone, 
<br />
and the clouds drift aside,
<br />
showing a clear blue sky, 
<br />
I cry.
<br />

<br />
When the rain pours down, soaking me, 
<br />
Not just in water, but in tears, 
<br />
I look up to the sky, shouting your name.
<br />
I cry.
<br />

<br />
Knowing far above my home, you stand, 
<br />
Im whispering words into the blowing wind.
<br />
Hoping it will carry them to you, far away.
<br />
I cry.
<br />

<br />
The sun looks down on me. I cannot stand it.
<br />
Without you, warmth has no meaning.
<br />
The wind returns to me, With no message.
<br />
I cry.
<br />

<br />
The birds sings songs of sorrow, for you.
<br />
I talk to them, hoping they can reach.
<br />
When the night falls, and the stars come.
<br />
I cry.
<br />

<br />

<br />
You will forever be in my heart Lizz.
<br />
Thank you for everything you did for me, 
<br />
for everything you were for me.
<br />

<br />
Joey, You know I love you so much and Im thinking about you every minute of the day.
<br />
If there is anything I can do, please let me know.
<br />

<br />

<br />
With love, 
<br />
Idariella / Linn</span><span class="gensmall"></span></td>
