				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Although many of us never knew her well, Soraea rezzed us, buffed us and made us smile. She touched many hearts in EQ and as such, many lives. That was a gift.
<br />

<br />
She will be truly missed... in game..... and more so in life. Thinking of you Par, Sorea's family and of her many friends. Walk hand in hand with angels Soraea.
<br />

<br />
Hug,
<br />

<br />
Purffects WW.</span><span class="gensmall"></span></td>
